# One CI gate, one file (issue #991).
ci_gate check-progressive-plan
  stage web
  description "R1188-U28, R1188-U29: docs/progressive-plan.md, the requirements placed on their resolution levels (closed, recorded, measured, partial, implemented) and on the root whose test pins them, matches the requirement-status ledger, and the requirements pinned only by a Rust test stay at or below the ceiling of data/meta/progressive-plan-ratchet.lino."
  run "node scripts/render-progressive-plan.mjs --check"
  justification "PR #1188 (R1188-U28, R1188-U29): the progressive JPEG method raises the lowest level first, so the levels must be generated from the ledger, never stated by hand."
